    "detailed_description": "<h1>Add to Wish List</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/e4ec85bf262de3b0aa9b5dcb7cc51de8.avif?t=1731311678\" /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/f95a3c79944ca2ce4ac8ebe84dd75012.poster.avif?t=1731311678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/f95a3c79944ca2ce4ac8ebe84dd75012.webm?t=1731311678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Dr. William, who is a slave to the desire for power, sends a research team consisting of Hannah Falkenhorst, Black Jack Kane, Grimroot, and Marco Rocio to the town of Golden Horn to obtain the Korion Jewel, which gives mystical powers to its owner. It doesn't take long for the research team, who are unaware of the powers of Korion, to realize that they are trapped in Goldenhorn. The guardian of the jewel with mystical powers has no intention of sending the team back alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exciting adventure where the roles of hunter and prey are reversed, join the team of bounty hunters and try to survive through cooperation, or direct the jewel guardian and defeat the bounty hunters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win this challenge, take on the role of good or evil, take control of your destiny, and survive no matter what! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/69cdd0336ee7719da61df9edd3ceac1b.webp?t=1731311678\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/72ed9e37c80902ea9571fe49da79edb4.poster.avif?t=1731311678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/72ed9e37c80902ea9571fe49da79edb4.webm?t=1731311678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Altarium is a deeply atmospheric horror game that can be played in both PvP and Co-Op modes, accommodating 1 to 5 players. You have the freedom to play as a member of Team A, where cooperation and communication are key to survival, or step into the shoes of Luxazul, the menacing character whose very presence instills fear in others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/e9d4ee3fd9cfcfe81cade831c2477312.poster.avif?t=1731311678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/e9d4ee3fd9cfcfe81cade831c2477312.webm?t=1731311678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>In this chilling world, every game is a battle for survival or domination, where the stakes are high and the tension never lets up. With its haunting environments, intricate gameplay mechanics, and intense multiplayer modes, Altarium offers an unforgettable horror experience that will keep you and your friends on the edge of your seats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/9dccf914f0179d682350db855d460d74.webp?t=1731311678\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/d9010212cd9b40d1ca9eba3a925678ad.poster.avif?t=1731311678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/d9010212cd9b40d1ca9eba3a925678ad.webm?t=1731311678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/a3b4cad4b622b71b39384f92e410483a.poster.avif?t=1731311678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/a3b4cad4b622b71b39384f92e410483a.webm?t=1731311678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Determine your strategy by using all the tools necessary to survive. Succeed in the challenge by using special character abilities, teamwork, and environmental advantages. Try to get ahead in the struggle for survival with the unique abilities and special equipment of your avatar. Survive as Team A or don't let anyone escape as Luxazul!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/3a4327a78539d8bedd0ea835d561fd6a.webp?t=1731311678\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/7c963db21115b9fc875202bf0c22bd4b.poster.avif?t=1731311678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/7c963db21115b9fc875202bf0c22bd4b.webm?t=1731311678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>We are excited to announce that Altarium will be supported with regular updates and will constantly offer players new content. Each update will be carefully prepared with the aim of adding new excitement for you. These updates, filled with brand new content, characters, maps, and equipment, will continuously enrich your gaming experience. Based on the feedback of our community, we are striving to make the game even more interesting and provide you with more options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/f95a3c79944ca2ce4ac8ebe84dd75012.poster.avif?t=1731311678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/f95a3c79944ca2ce4ac8ebe84dd75012.webm?t=1731311678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Dr. William, who is a slave to the desire for power, sends a research team consisting of Hannah Falkenhorst, Black Jack Kane, Grimroot, and Marco Rocio to the town of Golden Horn to obtain the Korion Jewel, which gives mystical powers to its owner. It doesn't take long for the research team, who are unaware of the powers of Korion, to realize that they are trapped in Goldenhorn. The guardian of the jewel with mystical powers has no intention of sending the team back alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this exciting adventure where the roles of hunter and prey are reversed, join the team of bounty hunters and try to survive through cooperation, or direct the jewel guardian and defeat the bounty hunters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To win this challenge, take on the role of good or evil, take control of your destiny, and survive no matter what! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/69cdd0336ee7719da61df9edd3ceac1b.webp?t=1731311678\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/72ed9e37c80902ea9571fe49da79edb4.poster.avif?t=1731311678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati