codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/a3b4cad4b622b71b39384f92e410483a.poster.avif?t=1731311678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/a3b4cad4b622b71b39384f92e410483a.webm?t=1731311678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Determine your strategy by using all the tools necessary to survive. Succeed in the challenge by using special character abilities, teamwork, and environmental advantages. Try to get ahead in the struggle for survival with the unique abilities and special equipment of your avatar. Survive as Team A or don't let anyone escape as Luxazul!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/3a4327a78539d8bedd0ea835d561fd6a.webp?t=1731311678\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/7c963db21115b9fc875202bf0c22bd4b.poster.avif?t=1731311678\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2524700/extras/7c963db21115b9fc875202bf0c22bd4b.webm?t=1731311678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>We are excited to announce that Altarium will be supported with regular updates and will constantly offer players new content. Each update will be carefully prepared with the aim of adding new excitement for you. These updates, filled with brand new content, characters, maps, and equipment, will continuously enrich your gaming experience. Based on the feedback of our community, we are striving to make the game even more interesting and provide you with more options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
